ntact information (only) for three professional references For full consideration, candidates should submit their applications no later than August 31, although review of applications will continue until the position is filled. Any final offer is contingent on a successful background check. If you have any questions about this position, contact  Provost@briarcliff.edu . A competitive salary is commensurate with teaching experience and academic credentials. This position is subject to final budget approval.",
